WEBVTT

00:14:58.309 --> 00:15:00.453
Which was making me more nervous.

00:15:00.477 --> 00:15:03.164
And there was no way to slow
my heart rate down.

00:15:05.204 --> 00:15:08.976
Normally, I would start
at 38 beats per minute,

00:15:09.000 --> 00:15:12.096
and while holding my breath,
it would drop to 12 beats per minute,

00:15:12.120 --> 00:15:13.976
which is pretty unusual.

00:15:14.000 --> 00:15:16.381
(Laughter)

00:15:20.366 --> 00:15:25.137
This time it started at 120 beats,
and it never went down.

00:15:26.358 --> 00:15:28.976
I spent the first five minutes underwater

00:15:29.000 --> 00:15:31.976
desperately trying to slow
my heart rate down.